{"name": "Anklav", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SURVIVE THE RUINS OF CIVILIZATION</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/dd8dd99591a919013f04e4fbbb0c149c.poster.avif?t=1784658082\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/dd8dd99591a919013f04e4fbbb0c149c.webm?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/dd8dd99591a919013f04e4fbbb0c149c.mp4?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Life still flickers in the ruins of the old world, but it\u2019s brutal. Mutants and marauders want your loot, while a living, anomalous Forest consumes the remaining safe territories. Survive this PvPvE MMO wasteland with other players, where every day is a fight for existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VENTURE INTO THE DANGER ZONE</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/37d4aa8bc9a2d921f61df7b5dd6acbcd.poster.avif?t=1784658082\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/37d4aa8bc9a2d921f61df7b5dd6acbcd.webm?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/37d4aa8bc9a2d921f61df7b5dd6acbcd.mp4?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the safe hub, it's crawling with monsters and cutthroats. But that's exactly where all the rags, scrap metal, and other junk valuable to this post-apocalyptic world are hidden. Can you survive the extraction and haul your hard-earned loot back to base?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFT YOUR OWN ARSENAL</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/0375a0876661bb9d1ca917302b685cd1.poster.avif?t=1784658082\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/0375a0876661bb9d1ca917302b685cd1.webm?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/0375a0876661bb9d1ca917302b685cd1.mp4?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the master of gritty makeshift crafting. Assemble firearms from old pipes, hammer rusty nails into bats, and buy blueprints to expand your armory. Build the perfect loadout to blast your way through the horrors of the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WEAPON MASTERY &amp; SURVIVAL SKILLS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/c08b88cb3bd8891eb6e46fe0a5df2eb4.poster.avif?t=1784658082\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/c08b88cb3bd8891eb6e46fe0a5df2eb4.webm?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/extras/c08b88cb3bd8891eb6e46fe0a5df2eb4.mp4?t=1784658082\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are what you use. Gain experience in specific weapon categories, armor classes, and abilities through combat and crafting. As your skills grow, you'll be able to push further into the deadly wasteland, survive tougher encounters, and claim more loot.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "ANKLAV is an isometric PvPvE MMO set in post-apocalyptic Eastern Europe. Explore a harsh world, gather rare loot, craft weapons, and survive with other players. Every raid outside the city walls could be your last. Will you return to base, or lose it all?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4790910/1ff9544a0f8d2d2c71cb01eeaf2416cd06c54318/header.jpg?t=1784658082", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["MMORPG", "Action", "Open World", "Adventure", "Military", "PvP"], "developers": "Fatfox Studio Ltd", "publishers": "Fatfox Studio Ltd", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4790910", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "29 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/2_TT1Z0uAfs", "first_seen": 1782684000.0, "review_rank": 337}